Z||000006||dogtired||12-29-1999||04:03 AM||||MonkeyMan I think he let that car go to the crusher cause he thought you were in the trunk!     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">   Ya Think?<P>Hello, My name is also Dave and I am also a Fieroholic.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I do believe the best way to get a good T-Top would be to buy one of the few Factory authorized cars. I also realize there aren't many of those around, either way will be a lot of $$$$ to get a good one. Good Luck||||reg||6
